<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal ola baal a Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan Pool wa mviaal ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolinte</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool áyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ wu ɛ̃kwel ol'afi-Kolinte me mvel wu ãku-ãtaan y'ãsɛɛn (56). Me nkuul a Timote, Pool ábɔɔ ãnsia m'ãbi me ndɔɔ ebvɔɔn li Kolinte. Obobɔ, ndɛ ombal Efedze, bu oyesa etso-tsoo ol'afi-Kolinte. Kɛn ãndɔɔ k'ãbwel ngesɛ wɛ, ndɛ bu akɔɔl Efedze. Ŋ'ekɔɔl ndɛ okɔ, ndɛ oswɛn bɔ ɔ̃nkaan y'ãnsia me mviil. Ndɛ oyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ me Tite. Kɛn ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ádziɔɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 2:4">2.4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:8">7.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ'ekɔɔl Tite Maseduaan, ndɛ ye Pool amwɛɛn okɔ. Tite bu awi ndɛ ãnsia mã ngesɛ. Mɔ̃ bu ãwi ndɛ mpwee yi aswɛn Afi-kolinte ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu. Ndɛ áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ mvel onse abeyuaal ke mbee a ŋ'éswɛn ndɛ bɔ wu ɛ̃kwel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãsɔɔ nsiaan m'ɛ̃kwel ãyɛɛn me ndɔɔ eka ki eli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a Pool y'ataal a ndɛ b'asam onse Ebvɔɔn li Kolinte (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1-7">1–7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɔɔ yi ekɛɛ ndɛ nguo meba. Ndɔɔ oyɔ eli ɔ̃nta wu esi ebvɔɔn li Ngelek, ye li Maseduaan, ye li Adzi minɛɛl, me ndɔɔ a ebvɔɔn li Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8-9">8–9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">M'osɛɛl b'ɔ̃nkaan, bɛɛn sɔɔ li kuun tiil li kuun y'ãtyel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 10-13">10–13</ref></char>), Pool awal ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a dzwɛ li èyi ndɛ, bvool atsweel ɔ̃sal a ndɛ wu ontam.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. Mɛ̃ nswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ye ndoo a dzii wu Timote ol'Ebvɔɔn e Nziã li bviil li Kolinte, bvool ol'akiool bueel ba ke nsie yueel yi Akayi. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obɔɔ b'obweel m'obweel o bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel Nziã, wu Tal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, ndɛ wu Taal wu oluul m'obvɛ, bvool wu oli Nziã wu abebweel baal ãlio mbueel! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Ndɛ abebweel bia-byɛ onse ãwua ã bia-byɛ mbueel. M'emfa okyɛ, m'obweel b'ebebweel ndɛ bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ ekoo k'ebweel b'ali onse ãwua m'emfa kieel. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ngwanyã, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn bia-byɛ ebemwɛn fool li bibi onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mãsia, emfa kiki hɛ̃ bia-byɛ ebebɔɔ obweel bo bibi me ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Okɛɛn bee eli onse fool, eli me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ebɔɔ obweel bvool ebvuul. Okɛɛn bee ebɔɔ obweel, byɛ hɛ̃ ebɔɔ obweel, b'osa kwɛn byɛ ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ ke nkwel fool lili li ebemwɛn bee. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Bee eli bam ye kaã me b'otal byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bee eyɛɛ wɛn, emfa ngemɔ̃ ki emwɛn byɛ fool li emwɛn bee, emfa kiki hɛ̃ byɛ ebɔɔ obweel b'ebɔɔ bee.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ngwanyã, andoo a dzii, bee k'edzii kwɛn byɛ edzɛɛn fool li emwɛn bee k'etswi e nsie ki Adzi wɛ: Bee emwɛn fool lam li enduru ɔ̃ndel lɛn bee ɛ̃wuul ɛ̃fi, ale k'ebekal ye kaã li ekal mwiĩ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Bee al'ebvi otsam wɛn bee ŋ'ebɔɔ etumbu ki epfu. Ngwanyã, ãndɔɔ ãbwel m'emfa okyɛ, kwɛn bee ebee kaã me bee-myam obeta, kɛn a bee eta lɔ me Nziã wu aseel b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ndɛ wu ábvuul bee bvool akieel abvuul bee m'epfu li obobɔ. Ngwanyã, bee eti kaã me ndɛ, wɛn ndɛ akieel abvuul bee bvool. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Byam hɛ̃ ebewuaal a bee ŋ'ebebuɛɛn byɛ me ndɔɔ a bee. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã àyoo ãbuɛɛn m'ebebuɛɛn baal bibi me ndɔɔ a bee, ndɛ àsa bee obvɛ obɔ, bvool baal bibi akieel abveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bee.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn b'eswɛɛl Pool ɔ̃wɔɔl a dzwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Ndɔɔ yɛn bee ekoo k'ekal y'obɛɛl o ntwel me yɔ, yɛn ãtsam m'ɔ̃kwal a bee ãtsweel kwɛn bee edzuu onse ɔ̃kiri, bvel-bvel ke nkwel a byɛ, ondɛɛl o nzuru pyɛ, bvool onse onsensal y'otaa-taa bueel b'ofi ola Nziã, ke m'ãyal m'ombuul wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Bee k'ebekel byɛ ãndɔɔ ãnkyam wɛ, bee ebekel byɛ kɛn a m'ebetsiɔ byɛ bvool ebekwaal otsɛn. Mɛ̃ etsam mpii byɛ ekieel ekwaal otsɛn o mɔ̃ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ kɛn emeekwaal otsɛn etsi-tsiri wɛn byɛ ekieel ekal y'obɛɛl o ntwel me bee, bee hɛ̃ ekieel ekal y'obɛɛl o ntwel me byɛ, me tsoo li ekieel eya Yeso wu Mfam a bia-byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Mɛ̃ éli ye kaã olɔ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, ŋ'éyi mɛ̃ byɛ otal, kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ obvɛ bo nsa yuaal. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Mɛ̃ ékedzii k'ebwel me li byɛ ŋ'èyi mɛ̃ Maseduaan, k'emwɛn byɛ bvool ŋ'èkɔɔl mɛ̃, kwɛn byɛ ewa mɛ̃ bvi ekieel ekal mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ o bvɛ, m'oyi o Yude. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ŋ'ékuru mɛ̃ ndɔɔ oyɔ, mɛ̃ k'étsam ngesɛ wɛ? Wuo ŋ'ebekuru mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ, mɛ̃ ebesa kɛn a ndɔɔ yi nzii myam, ekiool bvool ebee ndɔɔ yiyi? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ yɔ ngesɛ: M'ebeyɛɛn bee byɛ k'ãli mɛn bee ol'ekiool bvool ebee ndɔɔ yiyi wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a Nziã wu Yeso Mãsia, wu ebetee mɛ̃ ye Silivɛ̃ ye Timote k'ali «hɛɛ̃» ye «hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃» ekuu ngemɔ̃ wɛ, ola ndɛ eli kɛn a «hɛɛ̃». <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãlɔɔ ã Nzia ãli «hɛɛ̃» onse ndɛ. Obobɔ, me ndɛ bia-byɛ eyɛɛn Nziã wɛn «amɛn», m'olweel o ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Kɛn a wu awɛɛl bia-byɛ onse Mãsia bvool osueel bia-byɛ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, eli Nziã. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ wu osi bia-byɛ eliĩ e ndɛ, bvool olɔ Ɔ̃fel onse ɔ̃kwal a bia-byɛ, onge boo li ɛ̃kwel li eluɔ bvi ekieel ewa ndɛ bia-byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɔ ke nkwel a Nziã, ndɛ abam mɛ̃ okɛɛn mɛ̃ epfuru: Mɛ̃ mbee k'eya Kolinte, kwɛn ndɔɔ yi mbi ebee me byɛ oya. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Bee k'edzii k'eywɛɛn byɛ okiool m'oywɛɛn wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bee ebesal ye byɛ kwɛn byɛ ekal y'esɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ esɛn anã onse okiool o byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mwɛn ngesɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee ola byɛ obekɔɔl onse ãwua. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn myam wu esa kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ãwua, ke mɛ̃ mpaa me nã esia, okɛɛn ke me mbuul wu nsi mɛ̃ kwɛn ndɛ akal y'ãwua wɛ? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ m'emfa okyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'ètɔ mɛ̃, bɛn kɛn b'akaasa mɛ̃ esɛ, abee osa kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal y'ãwua. Mɛ̃ nkiool bam wɛn, esɛ e mɛ̃ eli esɛ e byɛ bueel. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ y'ãwua bibi, ye nyiĩ onse ɔ̃kwal, yi elel-a-elel. Ke me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ekal y'ãwua wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ dzii li enduru ɔ̃ndel li nzii a mɛ̃ byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzeel o wu osi obi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Okɛɛn mbuul asi kwɛn wukyɛ akal y'ãwua, wu esi ndɛ kwɛn akal y'ãwua ke mɛ̃ wɛ, eli byɛ bueel. Eyɛɛn wɛn baal ke kwɛ onse byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ebee enduul osa. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Mbuul wa m'emfa okyɛ, oyiaan b'emeeyiaan baal bibi onse byɛ ndɛ okoo. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ edzeel ndɛ bvool ewɛɛl ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ abee onse ãwua m'ãnduru ɔ̃ndel okal. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ luo wɛn esuo mbuul ondɛ dzii. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi ekie ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, m'otal okɛɛn byɛ eli ye lweel m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Kɛn a wu edzeel byɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nzeel ndɛ. Ŋ'edzeel mɛ̃ mbuul wu osi ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ kwɛn mɛ̃ nzeel ndɛ, mɛ̃ edzeel ndɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ke nkwel a Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />M'emfa okyɛ, Satana k'abvel bia-byɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ k'edzɛɛn ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ ndɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool akɛɛ nguo ke Tolohas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Mɛ̃ ntɔ etswi e nsie ki Tolohas me ndɔɔ yi etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia, ke ngwel wɛ Mfam áwi mɛ̃ mpwee yi esal okɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ékekɛɛ nguo bam, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ k'émwɛn ndoo a mɛ̃ Tite wɛ. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ndɛɛl baal a Tolohas, bu ngyɛn etswi e nsie ki Maseduaan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvel onse Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Bia-byɛ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn wu abesuul bia-byɛ ebebvel ãlio mbueel, onse Mãsia! Me nkuul a bia-byɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ abesa kwɛn baal ayɛɛ Mãsia ãmboo mbueel, onge ãnãsi m'etsɔɔn nswel ãmboo mbueel. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ngwanyã, ola Nziã, bia-byɛ eli onge ãnãsi ã Mãsia, me ndɔɔ a baal b'ali me nkuul yi obvuul, bvool me ndɔɔ a b'ayi k'odziɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Me ndɔɔ a b'ayi k'odziɔɔn, mɔ̃ ãli nswel yi epfu, yi ebiri k'epfu. Me ndɔɔ a b'ali ke nkuul yi obvuul, mɔ̃ ãli nswel yi elaã yi ebiri k'elaã. Kɛn a wu okoo k'asa ɔ̃sal wu obobɔ nã? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Bee k'eli onge baal bibi b'asa obɔɔ̃ m'Endɔɔ e Nziã wɛ. Bee bam eyɛɛn otaa-taa b'ofa ola Nziã, ke nkwel a Nziã, onse Mãsia.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Asal b'Ondoo b'Alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Bee bvool k'ebii nkuul yi esa kwɛn byɛ eyɔɔ bee wɛ! Bee hɛ̃ k'eli ye kɔɔ, onge bakyɛ, li ɛ̃nkaan mi esuo kwɛn atam bee wuo mi ɛ̃fa ola byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Byɛ mpii baal b'eli ɔ̃nkaan a bee, wu akel onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee, wɛn baal bueel ayɛɛ ndɛ bvool atsiɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Eli kal-a-kal kwɛn byɛ eli ɔ̃nkaan wu eswɛn Mãsia me nkuul ɔ̃sal a bee. Bee baal b'ebiri ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ. K'aswɛn ndɛ m'ɔ̃swɛn wu abeswɛn ɛ̃nkaan wɛ, aswɛn ndɛ m'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã wa mwiĩ. K'aswɛn ndɛ nkal ãnkɔɔn wɛ, aswɛn ndɛ nkal a tuo, onse ɛ̃kwal.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Olɔ kaã li ebeta bee me Nziã me nkuul a Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Bee k'eyɛɛn wɛn bee ebesa eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ me mpɛn a bee-myam wɛ, Nziã wu abewa bee mpɛn yi esa m'ebesa bee. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ndɛ wu osi kwɛn bee ekal asal b'Ondoo b'Alili. Ondoo obɔ k'otal ngel yi aswɛn m'oswɛn wɛ, bɔ otal Ɔ̃fel a Nziã. Ke ngwel wɛ, ngel yi akel ebam, kɛn Ɔ̃fel a Nziã awa elaã.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ãmpiri ã ngel oyɔ, áswɛn mɔ̃ nkal ãnkɔɔn, bvool Moyize ákesal me ndɔɔ a ngel yi ékebiri baal k'epfu oyɔ. Onkyam obobɔ, ɔ̃sal ondɛ ákewa ndɛ lweel li bibi. Onge bɛn osu o ndɛ ókenyɛɛn me lweel olɔ, afi-Isalayel k'ákekoo k'atal ndɛ wɛ. Kɛn a lweel olɔ k'ékeyiil wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Kɛn a me b'otal ɔ̃sal wu Ɔ̃fel wu, ndɛ kieel akal ye lweel li enduru ɔ̃ndel! <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Okɛɛn ɔ̃sal wu abiri baal k'etumbu obɔɔ lweel, bvel-bvel ɔ̃sal wu ãndɔɔ mã dzu akal ye lweel li enduru ɔ̃ndel. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, lweel li ékengal tsɔɔn k'ebengal bvool wɛ me ndɔɔ a lweel li enduru lɔ m'ongal. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn kyɛn k'eyiil wɛ éli ye lweel, bvel-bvel ki eyiil ekal ye lweel li enduru ɔ̃ndel.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Onge bɛn bia-byɛ eli ye kaã li obobɔ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ esuo ãŋã mã bibi. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Bee k'esa onge Moyize wɛ. Ndɛ ákefoo ekɔ m'osu, kwɛn afi-Isalayel abee k'efa lweel e Nziã li ékengal me muaan-lio nkal osu Moyize omwɛn. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Kɛn ãyal ã bɔ k'ãbekwaal ãndɔɔ otsɛn wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, tiil lio li ebekel bee byɛ ɔ̃nkaan li, ŋ'ebetsiɔ bɔ ɛ̃nkaan mi Ondoo bo Tsɔɔn, ekɔ okyɛ kɛn eli m'osu o bɔ, kɛn ambaal kyɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, kyɛ ebembal kɛn a ŋ'eyii mbuul bvoo ye Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Tiil meba, ŋ'etsiɔ bɔ ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Moyize, ekɔ ngemɔ̃ ebefoo ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul okiool Mfam, «ekɔ okyɛ embal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Opa 34.34</ref> </char></note>». <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Mfam oli Ɔ̃fel. Mboo yi eli Ɔ̃fel a Mfam, onkyal k'obekal wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Bia-byɛ bueel bɛn ãsu k'ãbekal m'ofoo wɛ, ebesuul lweel e Mfam ebemɔɔn, ebewal emfa e ndɛ onse lweel lɛn ongal o lɔ obewɛɛn kɛn owɛɛn. Mfam wu oli Ɔ̃fel wu abesa ɔ̃sal ondɛ.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Opfel b'onse asaan b'ɔ̃bwɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />M'emfa okyɛ, onge bɛn Nziã me nyiĩ a ndɛ, owi bee ɔ̃sal ondɛ, bee hɛ̃ k'eywɛn ãŋã. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />M'emfa okyɛ, bee eyɔɔl ãndɔɔ m'opfuru m'abesa m'edziɔɔn, eyɔɔl pfuru, ebee Endɔɔ e Nziã oswɛɛl. Kɛn a bee etee m'otaa-taa, kwɛn ewa mbuul wueel mpwee yi amwɛn kwɛn bee ebesal me nkuũ a Nziã. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kɛn okɛɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ebetsal bee k'eli kal-a-kal wɛ, yɔ k'eli kal-a-kal wɛ me baal b'ayi k'odziɔɔn. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Baal obɔ aywɛn okiool, me ndɔɔ yɛn Satan wu nziã wu ɔ̃kiri wu amaalɔ empeel onse ãyal ã bɔ. Ndɛ abekii bɔ k'amwɛn oyɔɔl b'ofa me nkuul a Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi lweel e Mãsia, ndɛ ndyam wu oli emfa e Nziã. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Nsia yi ebetsal bee k'etal bee-myam wɛ, Nsia yi ebetsal bee yɛn ndiri Yeso Mãsia oli Mfam, bvool ndiri bee eli asal a byɛ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã tsɔɔn áyɛɛn ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn oyɔɔl ongal onse empeel!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Obɛ 1.3</ref></char></note>». Ndɛ hɛ̃ osi kwɛn oyɔɔl ongal hɛ̃ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee, me ndɔɔ yi asa kwɛn oyɛɛ o lweel e Nziã ongal nkal osu o Mãsia.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kɛn a bee bɛn opfel obɔ oli onse bee, eli onge asaan b'ábuo m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, baal amwɛn kwɛn waan li ɛ̃kam olɔ efi ola Nziã, k'efi ola bee wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Bee ebemwɛn fool li emfa bwɛn emfa, kɛn omwwĩ o bee k'obesɛn oŋɔ̃ wɛ. Bee ebeyoo ãwua bibi, kɛn a bee k'ebewɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Abetuaal bee mpal bibi, kɛn a Nziã k'abeyiri bee wɛ. Abebal bee, kɛn a k'abebweel bee wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Lio bwɛn a lio, abebii bee obam onge b'ábam Yeso, ãmboo mbueel, kwɛn omwiĩ o ndɛ omɔɔn hɛ̃ onse nzuru a bee. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ngwanyã, onkyam ŋɛn bee eli mwiĩ, lio bwɛn a lio, ebemwɛɛn y'etsam bvi epfu me ndɔɔ a Yeso, kwɛn omwiĩ o ndɛ omɔɔn hɛ̃ onse nzuru a bee yi ekieel ekwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, epfu ebesal onse bee, kwɛn omwiĩ osal onse byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nkiool, obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Ãnz 116.10</ref></char></note>» Onge bɛn bia-byɛ hɛ̃ eli y'okiool baba, bee ekiool, obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee eyɛɛn. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee eyɛɛ bam ngesɛ wɛn, ndɛ wu áseel Mfam Yeso onse b'ákwi-ákwi akieel aseel bee hɛ̃ mboo mɔ̃ ye Yeso, bvool akieel asa kwɛn bee emɔɔn ye byɛ ke nkwel a Yeso. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ãmpal omɔ̃ mbueel m'ebemwɛn ãli me ndɔɔ obvɛ o byɛ, kwɛn nyiĩ a Nziã ekal yam ngamfɛn, kwɛn baal bibi abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn bibi me ndɔɔ a lweel e ndɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãŋã mɛn k'ãfa wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee ãŋã k'ãfa wɛ. Onkyam ŋɛn nzuru a bee ebebii etsii-etsii, ɔ̃fel a bee abekɔɔl ɔ̃nyiɔɔn tsoo bwɛn a tsoo. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãmpal m'ebemwɛn bee meba k'ãli y'otsɛn wɛ bvool k'ãyiil wɛ, kɛn a mɔ̃ ãyɛɛl bee lweel li ɛ̃kam. Lweel olɔ eyiil ɔ̃bu bvool enduru bam ãmpal ã bee. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ki ebebii bee, ke ki abemwɛn wɛ, ki ebebii bee kyɛn k'abewɛn wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ki abemwɛn, eli ki lio etsi-tsiri, kɛn a kyɛn k'abemwɛn wɛ, eli ki ɔ̃bu.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ngwanyã, bee eyɛɛ wɛn okɛɛn nzɔ a bee yi me nsie ŋã yɛn onge sɛɛ etsɔɔn, bee eli ye nzɔ ke ywel yi etuu Nziã. Yɔ eli lɔɔ li ɔ̃bu lɛn k'ábuo me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Obobɔ, bee ebeluɔɔl ŋ'eli bee onse sɛɛ ondɛ, bvool edzii bam k'eyekal ke lɔɔ e bee li ke ywel. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn nzɔ oyɔ efoo bee, bee k'èbekal odzuũ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ngwanyã, ŋ'ekal bee onse sɛɛ wu, bee ebeluɔɔl, ɛ̃wuul ɛ̃mɛɛ̃fa. Taa-taa, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn bee edzii k'embaal nzuru yi wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bee edzii k'elaal nzuru yi ywel, kwɛn elaã eswɛɛl emfa e nzuru yi ekieel ekwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nziã ndyam oyɛɛl bee me ndɔɔ elaã olɔ. Ndɛ owi bee Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, wu oli onge boo li ɛ̃kwel li eluɔ bvi ekieel ewa ndɛ bee.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Obobɔ, bee eli bam y'ãŋã. Kɛn a bee eyɛɛ bam wɛn, ŋ'ebekal bee onse nzuru yi, bee eli lala ye Mfam. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee edzuu m'okiool, ke me mviil m'ombuul wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Kɛn a bee eli bam y'ãŋã, bvool edzii bam k'esiil nzuru yi, m'oyekal ola Mfam. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee ebesa mpɛn yi esa ndɛ esɛ, ekal ŋ'eli bee onse nzuru yi, ekal ŋ'èmbal bee onse yɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan bia-byɛ bueel eyetsuun ke mbal a Mãsia. M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul àbɔɔ ki ebvaan me ndɛ, m'emfa ki ési ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'omwiĩ o ndɛ me nsie: Ekal ãndɔɔ m'ãbvɛ, ekal m'ãbi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal wu obveel b'ondoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Onge bɛn bee eyɛɛ otsɛn b'owa o Mfam bvɛɛ, bee ebesa mpɛn yam yi esa kwɛn baal akiool. Nziã oyɛɛ bee bam ngesɛ, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn, onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ bee bam ngesɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Bee k'edzii bvool k'eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bee-myam ola byɛ wɛ, kɛn a bee edzii k'ewa byɛ mpwee yi ebɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ a bee. Obobɔ, byɛ èbɔɔ ɛ̃dzoo mi ebveel bɛn ke mboo a k'abɛɛl ntwel me m'ãli onse ɔ̃kwal, bɔ abebɛɛl ntwel me m'amwɛn me mviil. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn ayii awal bee onge ewool, me ndɔɔ a Nziã. Kɛn okɛɛn ayii awal bee onge anga-ãyal, me ndɔɔ obvɛ o byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ngwanyã, dzii e Mãsia eluul ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee, ŋ'etsam bee ndɔɔ yi: Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ okwi me ndɔɔ a bueel, obobɔ bueel hɛ̃ akwi ye ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ndɛ okwi me ndɔɔ a baal bueel, kwɛn baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ abee y'omwiĩ okal me ndɔɔ a bam, kɛn a bɔ akal y'omwiĩ me ndɔɔ a wu ákwi bvool ásiool me ndɔɔ a bɔ.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee k'ebewal mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ. Onkyam ŋɛn bee ékewal Mãsia m'emfa ki ombuul, meba ŋã, bee k'ebewal ndɛ m'emfa okyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ŋɛn mbuul oli onse Mãsia, ndɛ ŋ'ayii mbuul wa alili wu ebuo Nziã: Ãndɔɔ m'ãtsɔɔn ãfi, m'alili ãwel mboo. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ndɔɔ oyɔ efi ola Nziã, wu obveel ondoo o ndɛ ye bee me nkuul a Mãsia. Ndɛ bvool owi bee ɔ̃sal wu ebveel baal akyam m'ondoo ye ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me nkuul a Mãsia, Nziã ákesal m'obveel b'ondoo o ndɛ ye baal b'ɔ̃kiri bueel, k'atal ãbi ã baal wɛ. Ndɛ otam bee k'etee Endɔɔ li obveel b'ondoo.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Bee eli antam b'etam Nziã me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Mãsia. M'emfa okyɛ, me nkuul a bee, Nziã ndyam abeta byɛ mbel: Me nkuũ a Mãsia, bee ebuɛɛn byɛ wɛn ebveel ondoo ye Nziã! <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Mãsia wɛn k'ási obi wɛ, Nziã osuul ndɛ oyii obi, kwɛn me nkuul a ndɛ, Nziã asuul bia-byɛ dzu.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Onge bɛn bee ebesal ye Nziã, bee ewi byɛ luo wɛn ebee nyiĩ a Nziã ngwel owal. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ olieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Me lio li ngesɛ, mɛ̃ éyoo yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Me tsoo li obvuul, mɛ̃ éwueel a yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Edz 49.8</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Meba eyii lio lam li ngesɛ. Meba eyii tsoo li obvuul olɔ.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃mbio mi ɛ̃ya me ndɔɔ otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Bee k'edzii k'ebal mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse obi wɛ, kwɛn baal abee mpwee obɔɔ yi apfiɔɔl ɔ̃sal a bee. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Kɛn a m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, bee edzii k'esuo kwɛn bee eli asal a Nziã ba taa-taa. M'emfa okyɛ, y'osɛ-mwiĩ bueel, bee ekuru ɔ̃kwal onse ãmpal, onse okaan, onse fool, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />onse ɔ̃dzii, onse etuul, onse atsuunga, onse ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ fool, onse ɛ̃nsiil, bvool onse ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />onse otsɛtsɛ, onse oyɛɛ, onse osɛ-mwiĩ, onse ongesɛ, onse odzuu m'emfa ki Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, onse dzii li taa-taa, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />onse ãtee m'otaa-taa, onse waan e Nziã, onse ãta ã mvel bvool ye m'akiaal mvel, m'ãli osa b'ãndɔɔ mã dzu, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />onse bvɛɛ bvool onse opfiɔɔl. Abeyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɔɔ a bee, abekwee bee hɛ̃. Onkyam ŋɛn bee ebeyɛɛn otaa-taa, abewal bee onge anga-mfya. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Onkyam ŋɛn bɔ ayɛɛ bee ngesɛ, bɔ abewal bee onge bɛn bɔ k'ayɛɛ wɛ. Bee eli bam mwiĩ, kɛn a bɔ abewal bee onge akwa-akwa. Bɔ awa bee etumbu, kɛn a bɔ k'abam bee wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Bɔ abewal bee onge anga-ãwua, kwɛn ŋɛn bee eli anga-esɛ ãlio mbueel. Bɔ abewal bee onge aywal, kwɛn ŋɛn bee b'ebesa kwɛn baal bibi akal y'opfel. Bɔ abewal bee onge akaan, kwɛn ŋɛn bee eli ye bvieel.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Afi-kolinte, bee eyɛɛn ye byɛ kal-a-kal, ɔ̃kwal a bee ali ndyam kal. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Bee k'ekuru byɛ ɛ̃kwal wɛ, kɛn a byɛ ekuru bee mi byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye byɛ onge b'eyɛɛn tal ye baan. Oŋɔ̃ byɛ hɛ̃, edzweel bee ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzɔ a Nziã wa mwiĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ebee obvɔɔn ye baal bɛn k'akiool Nziã wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo m'okal mboo mɔ̃ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ki eli dzu ye kyɛn k'eli ki Nziã wɛ, ekoo m'okal bvoo? Oyɔɔl y'empeel ekoo m'okal mboo mɔ̃? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Ondoo omã mpɛɛ̃-a-ampɛɛ̃ Mãsia ye Satana? Bvoo omã mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ɔ̃kiool ye wɛn k'ɔ̃kiool wɛ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ondoo omã mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ Nzɔ a Nziã y'etiɔ? Ngwanyã, bia-byɛ bam eli Nzɔ a Nziã, onge b'eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Mɛ̃ ekieel ekal bvool edzuu onse bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">mɛ̃ ekieel ekal Nziã a bɔ, bɔ akieel akal yam e mɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Lev 26.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:27">Edz 37.27</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, onge b'elieel Mfam:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">«Epal onse bɔ, bvool ekab nzuru ye bɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ebee onywɛn m'eluɔ e mbiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">m'emfa okyɛ mɛ̃ ndyam ekieel eyɔɔ byɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Edz 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34-41">Ezk 20.34-41</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Mfam Nga-Waan bvool olieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">«Mɛ̃ ekieel ekal Tal me ndɔɔ a byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">byɛ ekieel ekal baan b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26.12</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Andoo a dzii, onge bɛn Nziã owi bia-byɛ ãlɔɔ omɔ̃, yɔɔl kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal tsɛtsɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãbiil nzuru y'ɔ̃fel. Esa mpɛn yi ekal ba ngel tiil ntɔ, onse obal o Nziã.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛ e Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Edzweel bee ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ. Bee k'esi mbuul obi wɛ, bee k'ebiil okiool o mbuul wɛ, bee k'etwel bvel e mbuul wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi ebam byɛ me mbyel wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ onge b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ yɔ tsɔɔn, byɛ eli onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bee, bia-byɛ eli bvoo, ekal ŋ'eli mwiĩ, ekal ŋ'ekwi. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mɛ̃ ebeta kaã li bibi me byɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebebɛɛl ntwel me byɛ. Mɛ̃ nduul me mpɛn, nduul m'esɛ, onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ ndi onse ãmpal ã bee.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'etɔ bee ke nsie yi Maseduaan, bee k'ebɔɔ mpwee yi ewuun wɛ. Kɛn a bee emwɛn fool li emfa kieel: Ãmvel ngwel-a-ngwel, buɔ onse ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Kɛn a Nziã wu abewa b'emeefa ɛ̃wuun mpɛn, owi bee mpɛn ŋ'etɔ Tite. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Ki ewi bee mpɛn, k'eli kɛn oya o Tite wɛ, eli hɛ̃ owa b'ewi byɛ ndɛ mpɛn. Ngwanyã, ndɛ olieel bee efua e byɛ ki bibi ki emwɛn mɛ̃ bvool, elel e byɛ, y'ebal e byɛ me ndɔɔ yi etsweel mɛ̃. M'emfa okyɛ, esɛ e mɛ̃ ekoo nzuru.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ nsi kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ãwua m'ɔ̃nkaan wu nswɛn mɛ̃ byɛ, mɛ̃ k'etsam ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ etsam yɔ tsɔɔn, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ emwɛn kwɛn ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ asi kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ãwua me lio etsi-tsiri, <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />kɛn a meba mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ esi kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ãwua wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ãwua ã byɛ ãbiri byɛ k'okaal b'ɛ̃kwal. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eyoo ãwua m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. M'emfa okyɛ, bee k'esi mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ obi wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ngwanyã, ãwua mã m'emfa ki edzii Nziã ãbiri mbuul k'okaal b'ɔ̃kwal, okaal b'ɔ̃kwal obiri ndɛ k'obvuul. Obobɔ, ndɔɔ yi atsam k'ebekal wɛ. Kɛn ãwua m'ãya m'efua bvi ɔ̃kiri ãbiri k'epfu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />M'esa ãwua mama mã m'emfa ki edzii Nziã onse byɛ, mɔ̃ bu: Osa b'ãndɔɔ y'ãŋã, osɔɔ b'odzeel, obee b'ãndɔɔ m'ãbi, okal ye buɔ m'osa b'obi, odzii o k'amwɛn mɛ̃ bvool, okal y'ebal me ndɔɔ yi atsweel mɛ̃, owa b'etumbu me wu osi obi! Taa-taa, m'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ŋ'esuo kwɛn byɛ eli anki-nkyam onse ndɔɔ oyɔ.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ nkel byɛ ɔ̃nkaan, ke me ndɔɔ a wu osi wumɔ̃ obi wɛ, ke me ndɔɔ a wu asi obi hɛ̃ wɛ. Mɛ̃ nkel byɛ ɔ̃nkaan, me ndɔɔ yi esuo ke mviil ã byam, ke nkwel a Nziã, wɛn byɛ bam eli y'ãŋã me ndɔɔ a bee. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee ebɔɔ mpɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Bee k'ebɔɔ kɛn a mpɛn wɛ, bee bvool esɛ ekoo nzuru ŋ'emwɛn bee emfa ki éli Tite onse esɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ bueel ebvieel ndɛ ɔ̃kwal efyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ke nkwel a ndɛ, mɛ̃ mbɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ a byɛ, byɛ k'ewi mɛ̃ opfuru wɛ. Bee élieel byɛ otaa-taa ãlio mbueel. Ŋe ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn bee ékebɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ a byɛ ke nkwel a Tite, eli hɛ̃ taa-taa. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />M'emfa okyɛ, dzii e ndɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ eyii lam li nɛn, ŋ'eyeel ndɛ emfa ki élweel byɛ bueel ndɛ, y'emfa ki éyɔɔ byɛ ndɛ y'okuaal o nzuru bueel, ye bvɛɛ lueel. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'osia mpaa b'eta kaã me byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nta me ndɔɔ akiool ba Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Andoo, bee edzii k'esuo byɛ emfa ki esio Nziã ãbvɔɔn mã nsie yi Maseduaan nyiĩ. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Onkyam ŋɛn akiool b'ãbvɔɔn omɔ̃ ãmwɛn ãmpal bibi, bɔ aluul m'esɛ ki enduru ɔ̃ndel, bvool onse oywal o bɔ bo bibi, bɔ awi ãkab m'ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Bɔ awi m'emfa ki obɔɔ o bɔ, mɛ̃ bam ntsweel wɛn, enduru obɔɔ o bɔ, bvool awi ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Bɔ aluɔɔn bee bam y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel ndiri bee ekiool kwɛn bɔ ayuɔɔl wuaal li bɔ, me ndɔɔ akiool ba Yelusalem. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Emfa ki esi bɔ enduru ki éketa bee kaã: Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, bɔ awi nzuru me Mfam, ke mbee bɔ awi yɔ me bee, m'emfa ki edzii Nziã. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee esɔɔ Tite k'ambɛɛl ɔ̃sal wa nyiĩ wu, wu ébɛɛn ndɛ osa ola byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Byɛ eli y'opfel m'ãndɔɔ mbueel: Okiool, etiaal li oyɛɛn, oyɛɛ, nzal a ɔ̃sal yi enduru ɔ̃ndel, ye dzii e byɛ me ndɔɔ a bee. Bee edzii hɛ̃ kwɛn byɛ esuo opfel obɔ m'ɔ̃sal wu awa eluɔ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi eywɛɛn byɛ ndɔɔ osa wɛ. Kɛn a ŋengyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ me nzal a ɔ̃sal yi esuo ãbvɔɔn makyɛ, mɛ̃ ŋengwi byɛ mpwee yi esuo kwɛn dzii e byɛ eli taa-taa. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eyɛɛ nyiĩ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia: Ndɛ wu áli ɔ̃pfel, ndɛ okiool k'akal ɔ̃ywal me ndɔɔ a byɛ, kwɛn me nkuul a oywal o ndɛ, byɛ ekal apfel.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Etal ãtsam me ngwyi mɛ̃ byɛ me ndɔɔ yi: Eli ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ a byɛ, byɛ bɛn mvel wu abwel éli baal b'ɛ̃kwel b'ási ɔ̃nta ondɛ, bvool b'ádzii k'asa ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Meba, embɛɛl ɔ̃sal ondɛ m'emfa ki obɔɔ o byɛ. M'emfa ki éli byɛ ye nzal a ndɛ k'obɛɛn, esuo yɔ m'osɛɛl o ndɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn mbuul osi ndɔɔ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, Nziã akiool kab olɔ. Ndɛ abetal ki eli a mbuul. Ndɛ k'abetal ki eywɛn a mbuul wɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Ki edzii bee ŋã ke ki asuul byɛ bam aywal m'owuaal o bakyɛ wɛ, bee edzii kwɛn baal bueel akal nsiil. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Meba, byɛ eli ye bvi enduru ɔlɔɔ me ndɔɔ yi ewuaal a b'aywɛn a bvɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, bvi eli a bɔ hɛ̃ bvi olɔɔ ɔ̃ndel ewuaal a byɛ me bvi ywɛn a byɛ. Obobɔ, byɛ èkal nsiil, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />onge b'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">«Wu átwel eluɔ bibi, k'áli ye bvi enduru olɔɔ wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">wu átwel eluɔ etsi-tsiri, k'áywɛn a eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Opa 16.18</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tite ye b'asal ye ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ olɔ onse ɔ̃kwal a Tite nzal a ɔ̃sal yɛn onge yi ndi a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ okiool ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ bee. Y'ãŋã mbueel, ndyam owɛɛ k'ayi ola byɛ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Bee eyuɔɔl ndoo ngɔmɔ̃ ye ndɛ. Ndoo ondɛ, ãbvɔɔn mbueel ãbetuɛɛn ndɛ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu ebesa ndɛ, wu otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ yɛn, ãbvɔɔn ãsueel ndɛ k'adzuu ye bee me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu owuaal o bakyɛ wu. Atam bee ɔ̃sal ondɛ osa, kwɛn Mfam ndyam akal ye nsia, bvool kwɛn bee esuo wɛn bee eli y'ɔ̃kwal wa ngesɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Bee edzii kwɛn abee bee obi oyɛɛn, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃bɔbɔ a nzi yi ati yi awi bee obiri. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee edzii k'esa obvɛ, ke kɛn a ke mviil ã Mfam wɛ, bee edzii k'esa bɔ hɛ̃ ke mviil ã baal.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Bee eyuɔɔl ndoo a bia-byɛ ye bɔ. Ndɛ odzii bam k'awuaal a bakyɛ. Bee emwɛn epfuũ okyɛ ãlio bibi m'ãndɔɔ bibi. Meba, ndɛ ata kaã lam me byɛ, bvool odzii bam k'awuaal a byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Me b'otal Tite, ndɛ abedzuu bvool abesal ye mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Me b'otal andoo b'ali ye ndɛ, ãbvɔɔn ãtam bɔ, bvool bɔ abesal me ndɔɔ yɛn nkuũ a Mãsia akal ye nsia. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Esuo bɔ kwɛn byɛ edzii bɔ, kwɛn ãbvɔɔn ãkiool bam bvool ãyɛɛ kwɛn bee eli y'ɔ̃dzoo wu ebɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ a byɛ ke nkwel a bɔ.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ ãkyam m'asa me ndɔɔ ɔ̃ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Me b'otal wuaal me ndɔɔ akiool, k'eli y'otsɛn kwɛn mɛ̃ nkel byɛ ɔ̃nkaan wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn byɛ eli y'ɔ̃kwal wa ngesɛ. Mɛ̃ mbɛɛl ntwel ola baal a Maseduaan me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn bɔ wɛn: «Akiool ba nsie yi Akayi amaawal ɔ̃yɛɛl fa mvel wu abwel.» M'emfa okyɛ, nzal a ɔ̃sal yi eli a byɛ ewi baal bibi efua ki asa emfa kiki. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Onkyam obobɔ, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl andoo obɔ, kwɛn obɛɛl b'ebɛɛl bee ntwel me ndɔɔ a byɛ, obee ngwel okal me ndɔɔ yi, bvool kwɛn byɛ ekal bam y'ɔ̃yɛɛl, onge be ngyɛɛn mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn andoo a Maseduaan ayi ye mɛ̃, k'ayebɔɔ byɛ emeewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wɛ, bee b'eta kaã me byɛ, ol'eluul m'opfuru. Byɛ hɛ̃ ol'eluul me bɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ mwɛn ngesɛ kwɛn andoo atsɔɔn nkwel a mɛ̃ ola byɛ. Bɔ àbvool ɔ̃nta wu ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ewi byɛ lɔɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'èya mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èyebɔɔ ndɛ amaayɛɛl, oŋɔ̃ ŋ'ekieel esuo kwɛn byɛ ebewa ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, k'ewa ebveel kuul mbee wɛ.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Eyeel ndɔɔ yi: Wu akwɛn etsi-tsiri, atsam hɛ̃ etsi-tsiri. Wu akwɛn bibi, atsam hɛ̃ bibi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul awa m'emfa ki ewɛɛ ndɛ onse ɔ̃kwal, ãwua pyɛ, abee ndɛ oywɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã odzii wu awa y'esɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nziã oli ye waan li aluul byɛ m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'emfa bwɛn emfa. Obobɔ, byɛ èbɔɔ kɛn obɔɔ bvieel bvi eli a byɛ y'ekɔɔ, byɛ bvool èbɔɔ bvi esa byɛ ndɔɔ yueel yi ngesɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«Ndɛ awa aywal ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">obvɛ o ndɛ oyiil ãlio mbueel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Ãnz 112.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ndɛ wu abewa ɔ̃kwɛn ekwɛn, bvi ewa ndɛ bvi-odza. Ndɛ àwa byɛ hɛ̃ ekwɛn, bvool asa kwɛn bvɛ ekal bvam bibi, kwɛn obvɛ o byɛ olɔɔ kɛn olɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ekal apfel bam ãlio mbueel, kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'ewa ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. Obobɔ, baal bibi àbveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn m'ãkab m'èwa bee bɔ m'ãfi ola byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />M'ãkab omɔ̃, byɛ èwa akiool bvi eywɛn a bɔ, bvool èwa bɔ mpwee bibi yi abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />M'ãkab omɔ̃, byɛ èsuo kwɛn byɛ elweel Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia. M'emfa okyɛ, akiool bibi àbveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ okiool y'ɔ̃kwal a byɛ wa ngesɛ wa bibi me ndɔɔ a bɔ bvool me ndɔɔ a bakyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Bɔ àsuo byɛ dzii e bɔ li bibi, ŋ'èbuɛɛn bɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã osi byɛ obvɛ b'emwã. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Bia-byɛ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ ekab e ndɛ li emwã!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pool atsweel ɔ̃sal a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ nduɔɔn byɛ, me nyiĩ ye dzii e Mãsia. Abeyɛɛn ndiri mɛ̃ ndi y'okwal ke nkwel a byɛ, ndi y'onzɔɔ̃ ŋe ndi mɛ̃ lala ye byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn byɛ, ebee mɛ̃ oywɛɛn k'eyɛɛn ãyɛɛn ã mpɛn ŋ'ekieel ekal mɛ̃ onse byɛ! Mɛ̃ ekieel esa ãndɔɔ me mpɛn ke nkwel a b'abetsam ndiri bee ebesa ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki ombuul. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Onkyam ŋɛn bee eli baal, bee k'edzwaan m'emfa ki edzwaan baal wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãta m'ebedzwaan bee ye mɔ̃ k'ãli ãta m'ombuul wɛ. Kɛn a mpɛn a mɔ̃ yi efi ola Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi ebiil ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãtɛɛn ke nkwel a ndɛ. Bee etsal emfa ki atsam kieel ki ebi-ebi. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Bee ebvel atsam m'emfa bvieel m'ãli y'ondɛɛl o nzuru m'ãkii baal k'ayɛɛ Nziã. Bee eswɛɛl ãtsam ã baal mbueel kwɛn bɔ alweel Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Bee emeewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu ewa baal bueel b'aywɛn a lweel etumbu, ŋ'ekieel ekal lweel e byɛ ɔ̃koo.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Etal ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki eli mɔ̃! Okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri ndɛ oli wa Mãsia, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛ bubu: Okɛɛn ndɛ oli wa Mãsia, bee hɛ̃ eli ba Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ nduru ke mbɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ yɛn okwɛn b'éwi Mfam bee b'etuu, ke b'etsal wɛ, mɛ̃ kieel k'ekal y'opfuru m'obɛɛl o ntwel obɔ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ke nzii k'ekal onge wu awa byɛ buɔ m'ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ abeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ ndɛ ɛ̃li ye mpuru bvool y'ãndɔɔ mã mpɛn. Kɛn a ŋ'eli ndɛ ye bee, ndɛ oli y'okwal, m'eyɛɛn ndɛ otsɛn pyɛ.» <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu abeyɛɛn obobɔ ayɛɛ bubu: Emfa ki ebeyɛɛn bee onse ɛ̃nkaan me lio lɛn bee k'eli ye byɛ wɛ, okyɛ hɛ̃ emfa ki ekieel esa bee ŋ'èya bee osal onse byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ngwanya, bee k'edzii k'ekal wuo k'emvɛɛl nzuru ye b'abetsam ndiri bɔ bam ali baal ba ngesɛ wɛ. Ŋ'ebewal bɔ ãnzuru ã bam onge emvɛɛl li bam ye li bakyɛ, bɔ ŋ'ali onge baal b'aywɛn a ãyal. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Me b'otal bee, bee k'edzii k'ebɛɛl ntwel yi enduru ɔ̃ndel wɛ. Bee ebɛɛl ntwel kɛn a me ndel a ɔ̃sal wu ewi Nziã bee osa. Ɔ̃sal ondɛ wu obiri bee tiil ola byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ŋ'eyi bee ola byɛ, bee k'enduru ɛ̃ndel omyɛ̃ wɛ. Bee bam eli baal b'ɛ̃kwel b'ayi tiil ola byɛ ye Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Bee k'ebɛɛl ntwel m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bakyɛ, myɛn k'ɛ̃li onse ɛ̃ndel ɛ̃ bee wɛ. Kɛn a bee eta kaã me ndɔɔ yi: ŋɛn okiool o byɛ oyɛn nkwel, bee esa ɔ̃sal wu onduru onse byɛ, k'enduru ɛ̃ndel mi elɔ Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bee ekieel etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ k'etswi e nsie bvi eli lala ye byɛ. Bee k'edzii k'esal k'ãmboo m'ebesal bakyɛ wɛ, bvool k'edzii k'ebɛɛl ntwel m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ mi emeesa bɔ wɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ákel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn wu abɛɛl ntwel, abɛɛl yɔ onse Mfam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Dze 9.23</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu etuɛɛn baal, ke wu atuɛɛn nzuru a ndyam wɛ, wu etuɛɛn Mfam.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pool y'antam ba mfya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ee, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ emeekuru ɔ̃kwal kwɛn mɛ̃ menkal ye muaan-laa! Hɛɛ̃, emeekuru ɔ̃kwal me m'èyeyɛɛn mɛ̃! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndi y'ebal me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ebal e mɛ̃ ki efi ola Nziã. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ nsɔɔn byɛ k'ebaal ɔ̃lam ngɔmɔ̃, ɔ̃lam ondɛ Mãsia. Ngwanyã, mɛ̃ nzii k'esuo byɛ ola ndɛ onge nsam-ɔ̃kaal yɛn k'eyɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Kɛn a onge bɛn ntaal m'ãyal ã ndɛ m'ãbi-ãbi ápfuru Ebva, mɛ̃ ndi ye buɔ owɛɛl ãyal ã byɛ ãyebii, bu eyeyɔɔl okuru o nzuru o byɛ me Mãsia bo taa-taa bvool bo tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam oyetee byɛ Yeso wu okam ye wu étee bee, oŋɔ̃ byɛ ekiool ndɛ bam! Byɛ hɛ̃ ekiool k'eyɔɔ ɔ̃fel ɔ̃kyam wu okam ye wu éyɔɔ byɛ, wuo ekiool k'eyɔɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ekam ye yi éyɔɔ byɛ! Byɛ ekuru ɔ̃kwal m'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ etsam wɛn antam a byɛ b'anɛn k'anduru mɛ̃ bvɛɛ wɛ! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ wɛn ndiri ke ngyɛɛ oyɛɛn bam ngesɛ wɛ, me b'otal oyɛɛ o Nziã, nswɛɛl pyɛ! Bee ésuo byɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ kal-a-kal ãmboo mbueel, me mbueel m'esi bee.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ŋe ntsal mɛ̃ byɛ Nsia a Nziã yi Ngesɛ ngwel y'okuaal o nzuru bueel, me ndɔɔ yi endɛɛl byɛ, mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃ obi nsi? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Mɛ̃ nkiool kwɛn ãbvɔɔn mãkyɛ ãwa mɛ̃ furu, me ndɔɔ yi ewuaal a byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ŋ'éywɛn mɛ̃ bvieel ola byɛ, mɛ̃ k'ésɔɔ eluɔ e mbuul wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, andoo ba Maseduaan áyi mɛ̃ ye bvi éli mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ. Mɛ̃ ébee k'ekal pfuũ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, mɛ̃ ekieel esa obobɔ ãlio mbueel. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Me ndɔɔ otaa-taa o Mãsia b'oli onse mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse etswi e nsie ki Akayi k'akoo k'akii mɛ̃ k'ebɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />M'emã mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ? Me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ke nzii byɛ wɛ? Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nzii byɛ!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />B'ebesa mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èsa bɔ kɛn osa. M'emfa okyɛ, b'abii mpwee yi andɛɛl nzuru m'osa b'ãndɔɔ onge bee, k'abɔɔ yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Baal ba m'emfa okyɛ ali antam ba mfya, asal a pfuru. Bɔ abesa empa bvi akal antam a Mãsia. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />K'eli ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn Satana ndyam abesa empa ki akal ãnzwel m'oyɔɔl. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Obobɔ, k'eli ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam wɛ yɛn asal a Satana akal onge asal b'asa ndɔɔ yi dzu. Kɛn a ntɔ a bɔ ekieel ekal m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãmpal m'emwɛn ntam Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn wɛn, ebee otsam wɛn mɛ̃ ndi ye laa! Wuo, okɛɛn byɛ etsam obobɔ, oŋɔ̃ ekiool kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal ye laa, m'emfa okyɛ mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ntwel etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />B'eyɛɛn mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn bɔ m'emfa ki edzii Mfam wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn bɔ onge b'eyɛɛn wa ye laa. Ngwanyã, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ bam wɛn, mɛ̃ ndi y'ɔ̃dzoo wu ebɛɛl ntwel. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Onge bɛn meba bibi abebɛɛl ntwel m'ãndɔɔ m'ombuul, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èbɛɛl ntwel. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ b'ange-ãyal, byɛ ebekiool ewool bam ndɔɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Taa-taa, byɛ ebekiool kwɛn akaal byɛ ankyal, awɛɛl byɛ eluɔ, akuaal byɛ eluɔ, awal byɛ ngwel, abɛɛl byɛ m'osu. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'opfuru b'eyɛɛn ndɔɔ yi: Bee esuo okwal bam bibi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kɛn okɛɛn mbuul okie k'abɛɛl ntwel, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebɛɛl yɔ, onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn onge wa ye laa. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Bɔ Afi-Ebele ali? Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ kyɛ ndi. Bɔ afi-Isalayel? Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndɛ ndi. Bɔ ba yam li Abalayam ali? Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ wa lɔ ndi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Bɔ asal a Mãsia ali? Yɔɔl mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn onge wa ye laa: Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndɛ bvool nduru bɔ. Mɛ̃ nsal nduru bɔ, nsam etuul nsa bibi nduru bɔ, abɛɛl mɛ̃ bvool bam bibi yi enduru yi bɔ, nsa bibi mɛ̃ mfuul epfu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Nsa taan, Ayuda ayuul mɛ̃ asukɔrɔ ãku-ãtyel ye bva (39). <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Nsa tyel, apfel mɛ̃ ɛ̃mpaã, nsa ngamɔ̃, atyel mɛ̃ ãnkɔɔn. Nsa tyel, ebɛɛl ki éli mɛ̃ edziin. Sa ngemɔ̃, mwiĩ ɔ̃tsiin ye tsia ɔ̃tsiin, mɛ̃ ndyel etswel ki ekwii kal-a-kal adza m'ɔ̃ngwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Onse ãdzwɛ mɛ̃ ngyɛn mɛ̃ bibi, mɛ̃ mwɛɛn y'etsam bvi emfa bwɛn emfa: Etsam bvi nzal, etsam bvi edzuul, etsam bvi efa ola baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ b'Ayuda, ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, etsam bvi onse ãbviil, etsam bvi onse ɛ̃baan mi kɛɛ-kɛɛ, etsam bvi ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ye bvi efa ol'andoo ba mfya. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Mɛ̃ nsi ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ fool, bvool nsa bibi ngwel ɛ̃nsiil. Mɛ̃ ngyoo nzuaal ye nzal, bvool ngywɛn a bvi-odza. Nsa bibi, mɛ̃ ngyoo mfyɛ, bvool ngywɛn a ekɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn ndɔɔ yi esiil wɛ: Ndɔɔ oyɔ yi ebekɛɛ mɛ̃ nguo me ndɔɔ ãbvɔɔn mbueel tsoo bwɛn a tsoo. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ŋɛn mbuul osam onse okwal, oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyoo okwal. Ŋɛn mbuul osi ãbi, oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ɔ̃kwal obii.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Okɛɛn ndɔɔ yi abɛɛl ntwel, mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ okwal o mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Nziã wu Tal a Mfam Yeso oyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ k'epfuru wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel ndɛ ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu! <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ŋ'éli mɛ̃ ke bviil li Damas, mfam wa ke nsɛn ɔ̃kwɛn Aletas áketam k'akiaal ɛ̃nywã ɛ̃ bviil, me ndɔɔ yi asiin mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Asuul mɛ̃ nsool me fenetel, onse pɛɛ̃, m'ebɔɔ-ebɔɔ, mɛ̃ bu mvuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Emwɛn y'ãndɔɔ m'ayɛɛl Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ki ebvaan obɛɛl o ntwel? Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ngwel! Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ me ndɔɔ emwɛn bvi esuo Mfam y'ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛl ndɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃yio a Mãsia. Emeesa mvel kuun ye nã, Nziã ándɛɛl ndɛ ke ywel tiil ke mboo yi eli ndɛ. Ndɔɔ oyɔ ébwel me nzuru a ndɛ yi ombuul wuo onse emwɛn? Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ wɛ! Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn Nziã ándɛɛl mbuul ondɛ tiil ke paladi. Ándɛɛl ndɛ me nzuru a ndɛ yi ombuul wuo onse emwɛn? Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ wɛ, Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Ándɛɛl ndɛ tiil ke paladi, bvool ndɛ áyoo ãndoo m'ɛ̃kam, mɛn k'awi mbuul nkuul yi ayɛɛn mɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Mbuul wu obobɔ, wu èbɛɛl mɛ̃ ntwel me ndɛ. Kɛn a me b'otal myam, mɛ̃ k'ebɛɛl ntwel me ndɔɔ nkyam wɛ, mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ntwel kɛn a m'okwal o mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ edzii k'ebɛɛl ntwel, mɛ̃ k'ekeekal nga-laa wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ekeeyɛɛn kɛn otaa-taa. Kɛn a mɛ̃ k'esa obobɔ wɛ, kwɛn baal abee mɛ̃ lweel owa li enduru m'emwɛn bɔ ye m'eyoo bɔ m'ãfa ola mɛ̃.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kɛn a me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ mbee okal y'ondɛɛl o nzuru me ndɔɔ emwɛn bvi ɛ̃kam obvɛ, awi mɛ̃ fool lɛn onge nsiɛɛn yi apio onse nzuru, onge ãnzwel m'eyuɔɔl Satana, me ndɔɔ yi atuaal mɛ̃ mpal, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee y'ondɛɛl o nzuru okal. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nsa tyel, mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn Mfam, kwɛn ndɛ ambaal mɛ̃ nsiɛɛn oyɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Kɛn a ndɛ obveel mɛ̃ bubu: «Nyiĩ a mɛ̃ eluɔ ki ekoo me yɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, waan e mɛ̃ ebemɔɔn ŋ'eli yɛ onse okwal.» Obobɔ, mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ntwel a mɛ̃ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ onse okwal o mɛ̃, kwɛn waan e Mãsia emɔɔn onse mɛ̃. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ esia mpaa onse okwal, onse ɛ̃tswɛ, onse otuaal o mpal, onse ãwua, me ndɔɔ a Mãsia. Ngwanyã, ŋendi mɛ̃ onse okwal, ŋendi mɛ̃ ye mpɛn.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃yɛɛl a Pool wu ayetal Afi-Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Byɛ eywɛɛn mɛ̃ k'ekal nga-laa. B'akaalweel mɛ̃ mpii byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye ndɔɔ yi mvool mɛ̃ mbee a bɛn ndiri antam b'anɛn wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi y'otsɛn wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Eliĩ bvi esuo kwɛn mɛ̃ ndi ntam ola byɛ bvɛ bvi: Osɛ-mwiĩ o mɛ̃ bo bibi onse ɛ̃mbio, emvieel, y'emwã bvi emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Eluɔ emã ki ebɔɔ byɛ ki ebvool mbee a ki ebɔɔ ãbvɔɔn mãkyɛ? Ndɔɔ kɛn a yɛn mɛ̃ k'eli pfuũ me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. Oŋɔ̃ edzeel mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɔɔ yi mbi oyɔ!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Mɛ̃ emeewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu eyetal byɛ li nsa tyel, bvool mɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'èkal mfuũ me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ki ebii mɛ̃ k'opfel o byɛ wɛ, eli byam. Ke yam, baan k'abvool opfel me ndɔɔ aburu wɛ, aburu baal b'abvool opfel me ndɔɔ a baan. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èwa eluɔ e mɛ̃ bvieel ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, bvool èwa onkyam omwiĩ o mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ nzii byɛ bibi m'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ol'edzii mɛ̃ etsi-etsiri?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ k'eli pfuũ me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ, bakyɛ áketsam ndiri mɛ̃ ndi y'ãyal m'ãbi-ãbi, mɛ̃ éywiin byɛ bɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Onse baal b'eyuɔɔl mɛ̃ byɛ, eli ye ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn me nkuul a ndɛ mɛ̃ ntwel bvel e byɛ? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mɛ̃ esɔɔ Tite k'ayi ola byɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ eyuɔɔl ndoo ngɔmɔ̃ wa dzii ye ndɛ. Tite opfel o byɛ awel m'ãyal m'ãbi-ãbi? Bia-ndɛ k'eli ãtsam ngãmɔ̃ wɛ? Ndɛ k'aluɛɛn nkuul mɛ̃ wɛ?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Etel-nziil, byɛ ebetsam wɛn, bee ebebii ɛ̃dzoo ke nkwel a byɛ. Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, bee ebeyɛɛn ke nkwel a Nziã, onse bvoo a bee ye Mãsia. Andoo, bee esa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ekwel onse okiool. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'èyeya mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ye buɔ owɛɛl mɛ̃ ke yembɔɔ byɛ m'emfa ki nzii mɛ̃ wɛ, wuo byɛ emwɛn mɛ̃ m'emfa kyɛn byɛ k'edzii wɛ. Mɛ̃ eli ye buɔ owɛɛl mɛ̃ yemwɛn ãndɔɔ mã onse byɛ: Obel, ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ, mpuru, ombɔɔ, kwee, ɛ̃tswɛ, ondɛɛl o nzuru y'ɛ̃tsab. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ŋ'èya mɛ̃ ola byɛ bvool, mɛ̃ ndi ye buɔ kwɛn Nziã awa mɛ̃ opfuru bvool onse byɛ, bvool kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee olel bibi me ndɔɔ a b'ási obi ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. Bɔ k'ayɔɔl m'ékesa bɔ mã wɛ: Ãndɔɔ mã mbiin, obvool o ntal ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ y'ãndɔɔ m'esio ãkyam.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ãnkunkwa mã ntɔ y'ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Yi nsa yi tyel yi eyetal mɛ̃ byɛ. Ákel ndiri: «M'otsiil o ndɔɔ yueel, ebvaan ayoo amwɛn buaal wuo atyel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Det 19.15</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ŋ'éyi mɛ̃ byɛ otal li nsa yuaal, mɛ̃ éwi byɛ ãnkunkwa. Meba, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi onse byɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ bvool ewa mɔ̃ me b'ási obi tsɔɔn, emfa kiki hɛ̃ me b'asiil: Ŋɛn mɛ̃ ngyi byɛ otal, mɛ̃ k'èsio mbuul nyiĩ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebii eliĩ ki esuo byɛ kwɛn Mãsia wu ãbeyɛɛn me nkuul a mɛ̃, ndɛ wɛn k'ali y'okwal onse byɛ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ abesuo waan e ndɛ onse byɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ngwanyã, ábɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ áli y'okwal onge mbuul, kɛn a ndɛ oli mwiĩ me waan e Nziã. Bee hɛ̃ eli y'okwal me bvoo ye ndɛ, kɛn a bee ekieel ekal mwiĩ mboo mɔ̃ ye ndɛ, me waan e Nziã.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Emeebwɛɛl ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ngesɛ, bvool emeetsam, me ndɔɔ yi etal okɛɛn byɛ ebekal m'emfa ki ekal akiool. Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛn Yeso Mãsia oli onse byɛ wɛ? Yɛɛn wɛn nsɔɔ̃ byɛ k'ebwɛɛl ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ngesɛ wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Mɛ̃ etsam mpii byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bee bam k'ebvi onse ɔ̃mbio wɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Kɛn a bee esɔɔ ola Nziã kwɛn byɛ ebee ndɔɔ yi mbi osa. Ke me ndɔɔ yi esuo wɛn bee ebvel ɔ̃mbio wɛ. Ki edzii bee kyɛn byɛ esa obvɛ, onkyam ŋɛn bee epal onge baal bɛn k'abvel ɔ̃mbio wɛ! <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee k'eli ye mpɛn yi ekii otaa-taa wɛ, bee eli kɛn a ye mpɛn yi esal me ndɔɔ otaa-taa. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Bee eli y'osia mpaa me lio li eywɛn a bee mpɛn, ki nguo kyɛn byɛ ekal ye mpɛn. Ki edzii bee, kyɛn byɛ ebvool me nkuul. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋe ndi mɛ̃ lala ye byɛ, mɛ̃ nkel obobɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ekieel eya mɛ̃ ola byɛ, mɛ̃ mbee byɛ ãyɛɛn ã mpɛn oyɛɛn. Ke ngwel wɛ, okwɛn b'éwi Mfam mɛ̃ b'etuu, ke b'etsal wɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />M'osɛɛl, andoo, esia mpaa. Ebii kwɛn byɛ ebvool me nkuul. Ewa bakyɛ mpɛn, ekal y'ɔ̃dzi, ekal onse opi. Obobɔ, Nziã wa dzii, wu opi, àkal ye byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ebio bakyɛ ye dzii m'emfa ki ebvaan me baan a Nziã.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Akiool bueel abio byɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ a Mfam Yeso Mãsia, dzii e Nziã, ye bvoo wu Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, ekal ye byɛ bueel.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>